  <item>
    <title>公大激光C+轮：绿光激光全球领跑，3D打印抢滩AI液冷</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ab22d2ff04646b3a9555e47</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ab22d2ff04646b3a9555e47</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 07:26:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>近日，深圳</span><a class="normal_text_link mp_article_text_link" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4MzA3MzYxMQ==&amp;mid=2662446460&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=64f8d7bf15546f39e4e956207c12a4d6&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4MzA3MzYxMQ==&amp;mid=2662446460&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=64f8d7bf15546f39e4e956207c12a4d6&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><strong><span>公大激光</span></strong></a><span>有限公司完成C+轮战略融资。本轮融资由深创投领投，华胥基金（三一集团关联基金）、力合资本（清华系产学研资本）等产业资本继续加注跟投。</span></p><p><span>值得关注的是，新一轮战略资本加注距离</span><a class="normal_text_link mp_article_text_link" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4MzA3MzYxMQ==&amp;mid=2662455032&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=4dccddf34430086ee147baae92ccb6a0&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4MzA3MzYxMQ==&amp;mid=2662455032&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=4dccddf34430086ee147baae92ccb6a0&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>公大激光官宣完成数亿元C轮战略融资</span></a><span>仅过去数月。从C轮到C+轮，融资节奏进一步加快，资本连续加注，不仅体现了投资机构对公大激光核心技术和产业化能力的持续关注，也释放出一个强烈信号：随着下游应用市场加速打开，高功率短波长激光及绿光金属增材制造正迎来产业化加速的重要窗口期。</span></p><p><a class="normal_text_link mp_article_text_link" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4MzA3MzYxMQ==&amp;mid=2662436612&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=7ad4f085353e9c1cb895382b59859076&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4MzA3MzYxMQ==&amp;mid=2662436612&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=7ad4f085353e9c1cb895382b59859076&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><strong><span>此前，华创资本曾在A轮领投了公大激光，并在后续融资中持续加注。</span></strong></a></p><p><strong><span>【免责声明】</span></strong></p><p><span>本播客所述投资相关内容皆以交流分享为目的，仅供参考，不构成任何市场预测、判断，或投资、咨询、法律等建议。</span></p><p><span>*本期节目由华创资本「创·问」编辑部和ListenHub共同制作。</span></p>]]></description>
